# API Client and Auth Rules

- Route API calls through `~/lib/api/api-client.ts` `fetcher`.
- Auth API base: `VITE_API_BASE_URL` (default `http://localhost:3010/api/v1`).
- Use `credentials: "include"` for cookie-based session (BFF model).
- Avoid ad-hoc raw `fetch` for internal API endpoints.
- Extend fetcher with CSRF/refresh in auth feature phase — do not duplicate per route.
